                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Lukoba lwa Ashikeloni lulibona kano mala lurie. Babaandu be mu lukoba lwa Kasa balichuunwa lukali. Lukoba lwa Ekironi lwosi se luliba ne lilieyikina tawe. Kasa se lukhabe no mwami tawe, ne Ashikeloni lulianjukhwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaandu Be Chikholo choosi khukhwama aleeyi balimenya mu Ashitoti. Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aloma ali, “Ndakamia lilielola lie ba Filisiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaandu balwo se baliliakho lundi enyama elimo kamalasile tawe, namwe biakhulia bibiindi nibio bakaania tawe. Babaramamo boosi baliba balala khu baandu base, khuba nga be lisaaye lie kholo eya Yuda. Babaandu ba Ekironi balibalikha nga babaandu base, bulayi bwene nga Bayebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndiliinda kamaloba kase banamae se balibao bakhabiremo tawe, omukuluumi oupia siibi babaandu base se alibao lundi tawe, naboone siibi nisio babaandu base bapile.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
